    "detailed_description": "In the futuristic world of Kinetic Breakthrough, you play as Arin, an amputee with a high-tech arm enhancement given the mission of infiltrating a city taken over by ALAI, an artificial intelligence initially created to manage the city before suddenly going rogue and taking full control.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expansive metroidvania levels</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009650/extras/f4d4d11e82f8b2b80040e2db9044be69.poster.avif?t=1717202086\" width=600 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009650/extras/f4d4d11e82f8b2b80040e2db9044be69.webm?t=1717202086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009650/extras/f4d4d11e82f8b2b80040e2db9044be69.mp4?t=1717202086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the vast and unique areas of the city and interact with its inhabitants as Arin comes to uncover the nuanced, dynamic relationship between the city and ALAI.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collision-based combat and fast-paced movement</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009650/extras/43e5398fda5eb2c9702631d573a9593e.poster.avif?t=1717202086\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009650/extras/43e5398fda5eb2c9702631d573a9593e.webm?t=1717202086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009650/extras/43e5398fda5eb2c9702631d573a9593e.mp4?t=1717202086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use both the arm's powerful recoil and its built in grappling force to hit and destroy enemy drones and robots in the city!",
    "about_the_game": "In the futuristic world of Kinetic Breakthrough, you play as Arin, an amputee with a high-tech arm enhancement given the mission of infiltrating a city taken over by ALAI, an artificial intelligence initially created to manage the city before suddenly going rogue and taking full control.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expansive metroidvania levels</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009650/extras/f4d4d11e82f8b2b80040e2db9044be69.poster.avif?t=1717202086\" width=600 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009650/extras/f4d4d11e82f8b2b80040e2db9044be69.webm?t=1717202086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009650/extras/f4d4d11e82f8b2b80040e2db9044be69.mp4?t=1717202086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the vast and unique areas of the city and interact with its inhabitants as Arin comes to uncover the nuanced, dynamic relationship between the city and ALAI.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collision-based combat and fast-paced movement</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009650/extras/43e5398fda5eb2c9702631d573a9593e.poster.avif?t=1717202086\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009650/extras/43e5398fda5eb2c9702631d573a9593e.webm?t=1717202086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009650/extras/43e5398fda5eb2c9702631d573a9593e.mp4?t=1717202086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use both the arm's powerful recoil and its built in grappling force to hit and destroy enemy drones and robots in the city!",
